func:
// The set is shot on a fixed rig: one magnification and stretch for
// every frame. The first frame of a run trains golden-compare's
// transform to them and every later frame is pinned to it, as a line
// is. Without the pin the search re-derives that constant per frame,
// and on this set its misses alone were 7 of 24 clean frames.
if (msg.synth && msg.synth.index === 0) msg.trainTransform = true;
return msg;
